                <pb facs="0429" n="344" sameAs="frus:frus1919v02/pg344"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.51/859: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Haiti</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Bailly-Blanchard</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-08-20T18:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 20,
                                1919, 6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your urgent August 11, 5 p.m.</p>
                <p>Department approves substitution of “in accord with the Financial Adviser” as
                    insisted upon by Haitian Government. As it is advisable to have complete text of
                    protocol before the Department before sending full powers, you are instructed to
                    send by pouch a copy as approved by the Haitian Government.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
